# {{APP_NAME}} reconstruction adapter

This workspace contains only {{APP_NAME}} descriptors, routes, persistence keys, fixtures, evidence
references, views and tests. Generic implementation comes from IPALift's `reconstruction-core`.

Replace `APP-EVIDENCE-ID`, select the first vertical slice, add recovered assets through the three
`{{APP_NAME}}_ASSET_*` CMake values, and keep all app facts in this adapter.

Build on Windows by passing the location of IPALift's core:

~~~powershell
.\scripts\build-and-test.ps1 -CoreRoot C:\path\to\IPALift\reconstruction-core
~~~
